{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6f9d356b685e7bd41a6196d08c71a9b154d92cda0f8156242b350569dd567771",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b:2_4_048_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8e354bfc5222b38e77b5ff826a2eac6641d9966b42259b9356f53a693b328ee",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●●●●●●●P酱。\n现在能稍微聊一聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b:2_4_048_01_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2fd45ba82d6d10b46dbe1dd0c6e432b4602bf788d92529b3ef5bb1854b6ff4",
      "text": "嗯，方便的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b:2_4_048_01_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913ccc1de5b153588b4750df1ebdc966d7eb1b3b7ef2d436dcd87e3f243f9817",
      "text": "谢谢你。因为博览会的日子越来越近了，\n我有些话想再对你说一遍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b:2_4_048_01_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd6dc26465d43dfd2ebb0b872345717b7f5bea8d385f8ee78ef7e1b9ab89a1dd",
      "text": "这一次的演出，为了P酱，\n我也一定会让它成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b:2_4_048_01_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe87fb49b703fb91a0c6095daf9b638635cb80cac6b905642914eb07b8798c1",
      "text": "粉丝们自不必说，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b:2_4_048_01_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50f8da4abff75ff29bb86e30739f2b5c6eb18d6779d10a028c2be7e7c8920ee4",
      "text": "我也想办一场让一直为了我们全力以赴的你，\n能够乐在其中的演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_401_2_4_048_01_09_b:2_4_048_01_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9f81338b3855afec9c533144a2cf201319770631abf4cbece645cd10c8ad48c",
      "text": "为此，我也必须加倍努力才行。\n那就先说到这，再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
